  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">One cloth book; one paperback book, "5 year plan, literary companion;" 2 jute bags, one with words in English, the other in Hindi; all in an illustrated white cardboard box.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Screen + block printed, woven, hand-spun + sewn in India, 2010"--Page 2 of cloth book.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The 5 year plan is a seva (service) in honor of Mahatma Gandhi. Created in India, Feb. 10-June 20, 2010"--Dealer's description.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The work of 32 artists, printed on hand-loom cotton and bound into fabric books in rural India.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Of the cloth book there are 180 bound copies, 5 unbound copies (35 artists' proofs, 65 signed copies, and 80 unsigned copies).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Of the paperback book, "5 year plan, literary companion" there are 1000 copies.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="504" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Paperback book includes bibliographical references.</subfield>
  </datafield>
